WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:05.130
Have you ever wondered what the secret desire&nbsp;
of SCP-698, the Judgemental Turtle, is?

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:08.790
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:14.310
to snap a picture of SCP-698 while it was&nbsp;
sitting in its box. This was the result:

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.390
"No change."

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:18.810
Note: Photographer waited&nbsp;
5 minutes and 25 seconds,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:25.470
and reported being told that using&nbsp;
SCP-978 on SCP-698 was pointless.

